( Main knows the observed return, not Bram's current belief.
  Requests 10=query, 20=learn-return. Replies 30=account, 31=learned.
  Every packet is two bytes. One pending request; source is the route device.
  Query is not permission to learn. The response is used, not cached. )
@ask-bram
 #02 #0b STZ #1000 #0900 STA2 !send-witness
@learn-bram
 #0a #0b STZ #2001 #0900 STA2
@send-witness
 #01 #d9 DEO #d9 DEI ?done #01 #fe STZ BRK
@witness-reply
 #d4 DEI #02 NEQ ?done
 #0801 LDA #01 GTH ?done
 #0b LDZ #02 EQU ?account-reply
 #0b LDZ #0a NEQ ?done
 #0800 LDA #31 NEQ ?done #0801 LDA #01 NEQ ?done
 #00 #0b STZ !learned
@account-reply
 #0800 LDA #30 NEQ ?done
 #00 #0b STZ #0801 LDA !account
